@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Versioned invalidation and concurrent-fill safety
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Authoritative mutation commits new relevant version/generation;
:Publish actual post-commit invalidation if a cache is used;
if (Invalidation observed?) then (yes)
 :Retire affected old entries / admit exact new key;
else (no)
 :Retain repair need; correctness cannot depend on delivery alone;
endif
:Read obtains current authorized scope/version under actual guard;
if (Cache payload matches exact current admissible identity?) then (yes)
 :Validate actual usability and protected delivery conditions;
else (no)
 :Reject stale fill; rebuild only authorized exact data;
endif
:Apply actual admission ordering before returning bytes;
stop

@enduml